OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Mail leaving people without
OL,4,Apost 'for weeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in parts of Liverpool say they
OL,7,Fare sometimes going weeks without post.
OL,9,FResidents in the Mossley Hill area said
OL,10,Fthe service had become "erratic", and
OL,11,Fthat they feared they might miss
OL,12,Fhospital appointments as a result.
OL,14,FA local councillor said the community
OL,15,Fhad "lost faith" in Royal Mail and that
OL,16,Fhe wanted an urgent meeting with the
OL,17,Fservice and the regulator, Ofcom.
OL,19,FRoyal Mail has been contacted for
OL,20,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
